[
    {
        "content": "<p>Given <code>p : G.Walk x y</code> and <code>hne : p.support.tail ≠ []</code>, how does one prove <code>p.support.tail.getLast hne = y</code>? I have <code>getLast_support</code> and <code>cons_tail_support</code>, but the proof argument in <code>getLast</code> blocks <code>rw</code> (motive not type correct), <code>▸</code> fails to compute a motive, and <code>simp</code> with <code>← cons_tail_support</code> loops. <code>exact?</code> finds nothing.</p>",
        "id": 617038907,
        "sender_full_name": "Johan Magnus Aanderaa",
        "timestamp": 1786996980
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>can you provide a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mwe.html\">#mwe</a>?</p>",
        "id": 617039185,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1786997105
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SimpleGraph</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">G.Walk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hne</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p.support.tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[])</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p.support.tail.getLast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hne</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I have <code>SimpleGraph.Walk.getLast_support</code> and <code>SimpleGraph.Walk.cons_tail_support</code> available, but <code>rw</code> with the latter fails with \"motive is not type correct\" because of the proof argument in <code>getLast</code>, <code>▸</code> can't compute a motive, and <code>simp [← cons_tail_support]</code> loops. <code>exact?</code> finds nothing.</p>",
        "id": 617040663,
        "sender_full_name": "Johan Magnus Aanderaa",
        "timestamp": 1786997670
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SimpleGraph</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Walk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hne</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[])</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getLast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hne</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hne'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">support</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ne_nil_of_tail_ne_nil</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hne</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getLast_cons</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getLast_congr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hne'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SimpleGraph</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Walk</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cons_tail_support</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">),</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">SimpleGraph</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Walk</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getLast_support</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
