    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks both — bare <code>simp</code> did it. I had tried <code>simp [← cons_tail_support]</code> which loops, so I assumed <code>simp</code> was the wrong tool entirely. Lesson learned: try it without arguments first.</p>\n<p>And thanks for the <code>autoTry.onSorry</code> pointer, Aaron — that would have saved me the trip here. <code>getLast_congr</code> is good to know too.</p>\n<p>This closes the last gap in a moralisation argument for d-separation soundness (Lauritzen route), so it was genuinely useful.</p>",
        "id": 617262414,
        "sender_full_name": "Johan Magnus Aanderaa",
        "timestamp": 1787073649
